    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a ruined world where every mission could be your last.</strong><br><i>Ave Trail</i> is a fast-paced 2D survival game where you play as a lone survivor, scavenging resources, upgrading your village, and racing against time to develop a cure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face swarms of relentless zombies in high-pressure missions where running is often your only option. Return to your village to spend your hard-earned resources wisely: enhance your base, unlock powerful skills, or invest in vaccine research to unlock the true ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But resources are scarce, and every decision could mean life or death\u2014for you or humanity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-down 2D survival-action gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and unpredictable zombies</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgradeable village hub</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill system with progression over time</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop and distribute a vaccine</strong> to beat the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: 30 minutes to 1.5 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High replay value</strong> through player choice and progression paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> and a constant feeling of tension</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive long enough to save humanity?</strong></p>",
